  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNODC Container Control Programme in Lebanon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Container Control Programme will assist Lebanon in strenthening trade security adn facilitation at the seaports of Beirut and Tripoli with the ultimate goal of i) contributing to strenghtened border control and coastal zone management, ii) stability, and iii)  ecnonomic improvement.</narrative>
  </description>
